# Schemas and registry

## definePrompt

```typescript
export const myPrompt = definePrompt({
  id: 'domain.slug', // must match prompts/domain/slug/meta.json
  output: 'single' | 'system_user',
  schema: z.strictObject({ /* keys align with meta.json variables */ }),
  view?(vars) { /* only non-Mustache formatting */ },
});
```

Reuse helpers from `src/schemas/shared.ts` (`lines`, `nonEmpty`, etc.).

## Registration

Add to `externalChatPrompts` or the symthink-api map in the matching `index.ts`. Export `render…` and `…Vars` type alongside siblings. Mismatched `delivery` fails CI.

## Generated code

Do not edit `src/generated/*.ts`. Regenerate with `npm run generate`.

## New prompt checklist

Schema file → register in index → `fixtures/<id>.json` → `npm run docs:domain-index` → `npm run test:update` → `npm test`.
